  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "The Skath originated on Norkumsgath, an ocean world with climate similar to that of the now destroyed Earth. Our ancestors were the apex predators within the oceans and our pack-based hunting strategies quickly led to the development of a society.",
    "value": "海鳞族起源于海洋世界“诺库姆斯加斯”，其气候与现已毁灭的地球相似。我们的祖先是海洋中的顶级掠食者，以群体为基础的狩猎策略迅速推动了社会的形成。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The first records of our kind were carved in stone in the Tethys Valley, in a region that has always been well inland from the seas. Dating suggests thirty thousand years in the past was approximately the time when Skath first became amphibious. Based on the collected samples, they had a primarily meat-based diet.",
    "value": "我们种族最早的记录刻在忒提斯山谷的岩石上，该地区始终远离海洋，深居内陆。年代测定表明，约三万年前是海鳞族首次演化为两栖动物的时期。根据采集的样本，他们的饮食以肉类为主。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/2",
    "raw": "As society evolved deep below the seas, our attention was drawn to the surface. Not just to claim resources but out of desire for exploration, and it is then then we first discovered the stars and with them...our ability to dream.",
    "value": "随着社会在深海逐渐发展，我们的目光被吸引至海面之上。这不仅是为了获取资源，更出于探索的渴望。正是在那时，我们首次发现了繁星，并随之觉醒....我们拥有了梦想的能力。"
  }
]